      "date": "2026-05-29T11:57:38.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.36 (vs ₹1.21 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.36 (down from ₹1.21 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹1.20b (up 39% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹5.49m (down 74% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 0.5% (down from 2.4% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 48% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 3% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
