      "date": "2026-05-28T10:14:00.000Z",
      "title": "Balurghat Technologies Limited Announces Board and Committee Changes, Effective May 29, 2026",
      "body": "Balurghat Technologies Limited held a meeting of the Board of Directors on May 28, 2026. Mrs. Geetika Khandelwal tendered her resignation from the post of Independent Director of the Company with effect from the close of business hours on May 29, 2026, due to personal reasons. In view of the above appointment and resignation, the Board approved the reconstitution of the following Committees of the Board with effect from May 29, 2026: Audit Committee, Nomination and Remuneration Committee, Stakeholders Relationship Committee. Audit Committee members include Shweta, Arun Kumar Sethia, and Manik Chand Tater. Nomination and Remuneration Committee members include Shweta and Rajendra Dugar. Stakeholders Relationship Committee members include Shweta, Arun Kumar Sethia, and Manik Chand Tater.",
